                    <p>
                        REMEMBER TO SET PAYMENT METHODS & OPTIONS OTHERWISE USERS CAN'T MAKE PAYMENT AND FOR THAT REASON PUBLIC REGISTRATION WON'T GO THROUGH.
                        <a
                          href="/account/settings?section=billing"
                            class="btn-primary"
                            style="margin-left: 10px;"
                        >
                            Update Payment Method
                        </a>
                    </p>
                </div>
